      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Multi-shot video with camera control**\n\nFollow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **Shots and camera**: **Camera & Lens** sets shot size, camera move, lens and lighting from lists. **Multi-Shot Prompt** holds the shots and their seconds. Edit the text to change the story.\n3. **Clip 1**: films those shots.\n4. **Result, clip 1**: clip 1 plays here.\n5. **Clip 2**: starts on the last frame of clip 1 (the line from **last_frame** to **first_frame**), so the two clips continue each other. Its own prompt says what happens next.\n6. **Result, clip 2**: press **Run**. Clip 2 plays here.\n\nSwap models, shots and presets freely.\n\nThe key box is wired to the first HashBidX box. The other HashBidX boxes use the same saved key."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Multi-shot video with camera control**\n\nFollow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **Shots and camera**: **Camera & Lens** sets shot size, camera move, lens and lighting from lists. **Multi-Shot Prompt** holds the shots and their seconds. Edit the text to change the story.\n3. **Clip 1**: films those shots.\n4. **Result, clip 1**: clip 1 plays here.\n5. **Clip 2**: starts on the last frame of clip 1 (the line from **last_frame** to **first_frame**), so the two clips continue each other. Its own prompt says what happens next.\n6. **Result, clip 2**: press **Run**. Clip 2 plays here.\n\nSwap models, shots and presets freely.\n\nThe key box is wired to the first HashBidX box. The other HashBidX boxes use the same saved key."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
